---
title: "create_price_feeds_using_accumulator (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: latest_only = state::assert_latest_only(pyth_state)
    q_version --> q_check_source: is_valid_data_source(pyth_state, vaa_source)
    q_check_source --> q_abort_src: false, abort E_INVALID_DATA_SOURCE
    q_check_source --> q_parse: true
    q_parse --> q_decode: cursor = cursor::new(accumulator_message)
    q_decode --> q_verify: price_infos = accumulator::parse_and_verify(cursor, vaa_payload, clock)
    q_verify --> q_create: create_and_share_price_feeds(latest_only, pyth_state, price_infos, ctx)
    q_create --> q_cleanup: cursor::take_rest(cursor)
    q_cleanup --> [*]: return

    note right of q_check_source
        INV-001: VAA emitter must be a registered data source
        INV-002: accumulator message must be fully consumed
        INV-003: only the latest contract version can create price feeds
    end note
